# tally 2.2.1 (S-from), L §6.4 "an instance whose day falls before D is left out", and L §4.4 for a window across
# D: extra is dated window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) in a scenario from 2026-05-01, so it books nothing on the window's
# days before D and books on those from D: s_after is the hole naming w (pinned days give 750.00 and 850.00 PLN, s_d28
# and s_d02), nothing before from changes. tally 2.2 left extra out by its window's first day: 750.00 PLN. cnt (a
# binding over a span the window crosses, in the base) stays the hole: the round's guard (the planner's cells/).
=== base.tally
model cb
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input wa: date
input wb: date
input sp: month
input bank: observed
move pa: transfers
  on wa
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
move pb: transfers
  on wb
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  sp = 2026-03 "s"
  w = window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) "s"
  wa = window(2026-03-28, 2026-04-02) "s"
  wb = window(2026-03-10, 2026-03-12) "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-05
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 640.00 PLN at 2026-03-20 end "saldo"
version fix
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-08
  anchor konto
  replace stated[konto] = 650.00 PLN at 2026-03-20 end "saldo, poprawione"
ask cnt: count(m in transfers over sp)
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over cb
  tally 2
  from 2026-05-01
move extra: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
ask s_after: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
ask s_d28: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask s_d02: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
=== expect
cnt: ?"date within window(2026-03-28, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for a binding over transfers" (pa)
  unknown day: wa
  unfulfilled: pa
  unfulfilled: pb
  cut 2026-06-10
s_after: ?"date within window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) not precise enough for a balance" (extra)
  unknown day: w
  world: sc
  anchor: konto 2026-03-20 end, stated 650.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pa
  cut 2026-06-10
s_d02: 850.00 PLN
  pinned: w = 2026-05-02
  world: sc
  anchor: konto 2026-03-20 end, stated 650.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: extra
  unfulfilled: pa
  cut 2026-06-10
s_d28: 750.00 PLN
  world: sc
  anchor: konto 2026-03-20 end, stated 650.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pa
  left out: extra, 1 instances, first 2026-04-29
  cut 2026-06-10
